# Environment variables for the Zillow Undervalued Property Research project.
#
# Current status: no code in this repo reads environment variables yet.
# Zillow data currently enters the pipeline as manually-pasted output from
# the Zillow connector via ChatGPT (see prompts/ and docs/zillow_field_notes.md),
# saved directly into data/raw/. src/zillow_client.py is an empty placeholder
# for a future direct-API integration.
#
# When that integration is built, it is expected to need a key like:
# ZILLOW_API_KEY=

# Never commit a real .env file — only this .env.example template is tracked.
